{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmzUQyoLR4TeizRrqk9u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**My answer:** The page did not compare my fund. It put it in the list, but where the others have a shekel number, mine says \"אין מחיר כאן\" and \"עוד לא נאסף\". So I still don't know if it's cheaper or dearer than the Israeli ones, and I'll ask you or the bank before I do anything.\n\n**How it went, step by step (as I'd tell my son):**\n- **Screen 1:** The title is \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\", but the very next things are English letters, S&P 500 and MSCI. I only stayed because I came for this fund. The big number I took away was \"86,492 ₪\" for \"פסגות\" with \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500\". I left the coloured bar alone. There are lots of colours in the key, it's dark, and I couldn't match the colours to the numbers.\n- **Screen 2:** I went down the long list of funds, and every one has the same coloured little labels again and again (\"חשיפה לדולר\", \"צוברת\", \"מס גם על שינוי המטבע\"). I read them over and over to find what was different, and it tired me. The red minuses scared me: \"−3,671\", \"−4,492\".\n- **Then I found my fund:** \"iShares S&P 500 Swap UCITS ETF USD (Acc)\", \"דמי ניהול שנתיים: 0.05%\". Next to it there's no shekel amount, just \"עוד לא נאסף\" and \"אין מחיר כאן\". Under it is a red label \"מס רק במכירה\".\n- **Screen 3:** A short note explains: \"בתעריפון אין שורה לניירות ערך זרים\". So the bank's price list has nothing for foreign funds. That's why mine has no number. There's also a red \"−23,766\" on a fund marked \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\".\n- **Screen 4:** A graph with crossing lines, then bar charts with minuses down to \"−21.8%\". That's where I stopped. Too many numbers, and I was worried.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** ETF, UCITS, Swap, Acc, \"W-8BEN\", \"צוברת\", \"מחלקת דיבידנד\", \"גידור/מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"נקנית בחו\"ל\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"מס רק במכירה\", and \"4D\" / \"4A\" next to the names. The grey text on the dark background is small and hard to read, and so are the numbers inside the coloured bars (\"5,703\", \"356\", \"699\")."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3565,"cache_read_input_tokens":14829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3565},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3785fcf-2c88-4f92-bee3-a1b4463dd760","uuid":"cebcfc62-2513-456c-8925-38f938f1d0fe","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:29:52.947Z","request_id":"req_011CgmzUQjR1oFxSZpLguvFJ"}
